From: PiSight diagnostics
Subject: [PATCH] dwc2: record bounded isochronous interrupt-cause evidence

Diagnostic only. Preserve transfer selection and recovery behavior. Record
interrupt causes, handler time, request arm frames and bounded disable-decision
samples. An early-EOPF classification is conditional timing evidence, not a
claim of audio origin or preventable packet loss. No printing in IRQ context.

